    "5.10.75.1(2)@1075-2026": {
      "explanation": "By-law 1075-2026 replaces the clause that exempts renewable energy projects from the zoning rules. The exemption now refers to the Electricity Act and the Planning Act instead of the Green Energy Act, and still covers undertakings, projects, sources and related goods and services that provincial law shields from municipal restrictions.",
